		// model, the gradient colours and every animation are untouched — only
		// the track/fill/handle geometry changes.
		//   "rounded" — the original: 24px track with a 7px corner radius and a
		//               22x26 pill handle that overhangs the track slightly.
		//   "capsule" — a long capsule track, a capsule fill, and a small round
		//               white handle that sits INSIDE the capsule.
		// The handle travel must match the CSS radius/width, so the geometry
		// lives here as data rather than being hard-coded in the drag maths.
		// ------------------------------------------------------------------
