			// never appear where it claimed to.
			// ---- 晚霞 (sunset) ----------------------------------------------
			// COLOURS ARE SAMPLED FROM THE REFERENCE PHOTO, not invented. A
			// coarse median-cut of it yields exactly four families, and the bar
			// reproduces them in the same vertical order the sky itself has:
			//   长春花蓝 #8fa5f6 / #7982d7          (the blue overhead)
			//   紫罗兰   #7472a3 / #695d6d          (the violet mid-sky)
			//   玫瑰褐   #92747d / #c68473          (the mauve cloud undersides)
			//   金橙     #fdc96c / #eea76b / #fbde97 / #fdf1a5   (the glow below)
			//
			// Unlike the Fluid style this one is DELIBERATELY stratified: a
			// sunset sky IS blue above and gold below, so the ground is a
			// vertical gradient and the cloud layers sit wherever the roll puts
			// them. "不规则变化" comes from three independently drifting layers
